eporting deadlines on incidents, draft the regulatory report, and read each site's security score.",{"title":158,"path":159,"stem":160,"description":1153,"icon":43},"Feed Suricata and Wazuh alerts into Dodock Wolf, through the agent or the Wazuh integration, and find every source's events for one IP, host, site or user.",1795021732851]